==Quality==

* [[{{PAGENAME}}]] Quality = <math>{\frac{_{q}Hide + _{q}Wool+ _{q}Glue+ _{q}Hardened Leather+ _{q}Strap}{5}}</math> and is [[softcap|softcapped]] by <math>\sqrt[2]{Dexterity*Sewing}</math>.


